# Approach 1:

# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(NlogN)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int longestSubsequence(int[] nums) {
        Arrays.sort(nums);
        if (nums[nums.length - 1] != 0) {
            int xor = 0;
            for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
                xor ^= nums[i];
            }
            if (xor == 0) {
                return nums.length - 1;
            }
            return nums.length;
        }

        return 0;
    }
}
```

# Approach 2:

# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(N)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int longestSubsequence(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int xor = 0;

        if (!isAllZero(nums)) {
            for (int num : nums) {
                xor ^= num;
            }
            return (xor == 0) ? n - 1 : n;
        }
        return 0;
    }

    private boolean isAllZero(int[] nums) {
        for (int num : nums) {
            if (num != 0) {
                return false;
            }
        }
        return true;
    }
}
```
